<title>USA: Jean Phillipe, S.T. Dupont in deal.</title>
<headline>Jean Phillipe, S.T. Dupont in deal.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jean Philippe Fragrances Inc said Tuesday S.T. Dupont granted its subsidiary, Inter Parfums SA the development and distribution rights of perfume lines under its brand name.</p>
<p>Inter Parfums will develop an S.T. Dupont perfume line, scheduled for launch through within the next twelve to eighteen months.</p>
<p>S.T. Dupont has operations in 114 countries and generated sales of FRF 578 million in the 96/97 financial year.</p>
<p>Inter Parfums has a presence in more than 100 countries and posted 1996 sales of 201 million french francs.</p>
</text>
